Derived material:

- Detection pattern text and analyzer semantics re-expressed in Go under
  skillgate/difftest/ (SK-P* rules; each records its upstream rule ID in
  Origin).
- The UTS #39 ASCII confusable skeleton table (upstream
  unicode_confusables.py, generated from Unicode 17 confusables.txt),
  ported to Go at skillgate/confusables.go and, for the self-contained
  differential module, at skillgate/difftest/ae6_skeleton.go. Both copies
  are pinned to one digest by confusables_test.go in each module.
- Test fixtures under skillgate/difftest/testdata/upstream/, copied
  verbatim from upstream tests/fixtures/.

Upstream does not ship a NOTICE file; this file serves as the required
attribution.
